usage: api_canary.py [-h] --private-config PRIVATE_CONFIG --evidence-dir
                     EVIDENCE_DIR [--pause-at-running]
                     [--label {manual,before_external_restart,after_external_restart}]
                     {run,resume,observe}

Bounded public/synthetic HTTP canary. No credential issuance or service
control. Requires an existing owner session in an absolute, regular 0600 JSON
file. See api-canary-engineering/README.md before explicitly executing against
production.

positional arguments:
  {run,resume,observe}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --private-config PRIVATE_CONFIG
  --evidence-dir EVIDENCE_DIR
  --pause-at-running
  --label {manual,before_external_restart,after_external_restart}
